 "text": "Hi, how are you doing? That's really common. It' your muscles getting a bit antsy from being used but not used to the intensity. Okay, here goes. Take it down a few gears and pedal with one leg while the other one rests. It feels weird at first, but it helps a lot. Also, leaning slightly into the pain and taking deep breaths helps too. No need to lean too hard, just enough that it feels better. Take it down another level.pedal with one leg and breathe deeply. Then it sounds like you need check it over. A proper saddle shouldn't feel like that.",
